# Packaging & native modules

## better-sqlite3 ABI

- **Vitest / CI** need the **Node** ABI. `postinstall` must skip `electron-rebuild` when `CI=true`.
- **Packaged app** needs the **Electron** ABI. Package scripts run `rebuild:native` **before** electron-builder.
- Never “fix” CI tests by rebuilding for Electron in `postinstall`.

## electron-builder

- Always `--publish never` (and `publish: null`). Releases upload via `.github/workflows/release.yml` (`softprops/action-gh-release`), not electron-builder publish (`GH_TOKEN`).
- Windows PE for `better-sqlite3`: `scripts/beforePack.cjs` must leave a win32 `.node` (MZ), not Linux ELF, when packing `win32`.
- Keep `asarUnpack` for `better-sqlite3` / `bindings` so Windows `require()` works.

## Windows launch / ICU

- Sandboxed Chromium children need AppContainer RX on the install tree or you get `Invalid file descriptor to ICU data received`.
- NSIS `build/installer.nsh` grants `S-1-15-2-1` and `S-1-15-2-2` on `$INSTDIR` — do not remove without a replacement.
- Prefer local install paths; network/OneDrive folders break ICU mmap.

## Linux AppImage autostart

- `app.setLoginItemSettings` is **macOS/Windows only**. Linux uses XDG `~/.config/autostart/open-tick.desktop` (`linuxAutostart.ts`).
- Exec must be `$APPIMAGE` when set — never the FUSE mount `process.execPath`.
